extras/636f16edffeedef76666f451014677a5.avif?t=1702878040\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570760/extras/b74ab9450ff4a7b93385f1b86a1bc8f6.avif?t=1702878040\" /></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1570760/extras/9933d53d2ad4187df29b27770a5354a8.avif?t=1702878040\" /></div><br></li><li> Fragmentation group. The acquisition of equipment and plug-ins will be different from the random acquisition of the previous game, but you can use the shard group to arrange the acquisition of your equipment and plug-ins in advance before the game enters. The fragment group is obtained by using the money obtained in the game to extract.</li></ul>",
